WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.556
Resume after a shock.

00:00:01.556 --> 00:00:09.709
Restart chest compressions immediately after the shock and continue until the AED announces its next analysis.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:14.675
Current guidance states that re-analysis repeats every two minutes.
